  "description": "The Supreme was developed with the input of Fuji's pro women racers of the past half-decade. The Supreme incorporates the best materials and design technologies of Fuji's top-of-the-line carbon road platforms into a women's- specific package that combines superior handling, comfort and stiffness with optimum fit. The Supreme benefits from the exceptional stiffness of RIB technology making it a particularly powerful bike for sprinters and criterium racers. The frame's layup schedule is tailored specifically to a woman's traditionally lighter body mass. Women's-specific geometry makes for a shorter top tube and more stand-over clearance. Women's-specific saddle, narrower handlebars and reach-adjust brake levers improve the rider's contact with the bike as well as confidence. RIB technology is a reinforcing rib that runs the length of the oversized down tube and fork blades, amplifying stiffness in the fork for razor- sharp steering precision and in the downtube for exceptional power transfer",
